stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Active: registerMember()\n(MembershipController)

    Active --> Expired: end_date passes\n(evaluated by isActive())
    Active --> Suspended: suspendMembership()\n(Admin/Receptionist action)

    Expired --> Active: renewMembership()\nor processPayment() succeeds
    Suspended --> Active: renewMembership()

    Expired --> [*]: member never renews
    Suspended --> [*]: member never renews

    note right of Active
        Grants gym access (checkIn),
        grants class booking (bookClass)
    end note

    note right of Expired
        Check-in denied (SRS 3.2.3
        alternate flow: "Membership
        has expired")
    end note

    note right of Suspended
        Check-in and booking denied.
        Set by staff via
        MembershipController.suspendMembership()
    end note
